# Screenshots — used only for ad-hoc issue reports / iteration aids,
# never meant to be checked in. Anchored to the repo root so a
# `screens/` directory nested elsewhere isn't accidentally ignored.
/screens/

# Local databases and device backups — never checked in.
#
# These are scratch artifacts: a `data/dto.db` from ad-hoc SQLite poking, and
# `adb backup` archives. The app's real stores live in its sandbox container
# (~/Library/Containers/<bundle-id>/Data/Library/Application Support/), never in
# the repo. This matters beyond tidiness: the local configuration store is
# plaintext (see docs/CREDENTIAL_STORAGE.md), so a committed database file would
# publish whatever database tokens, license tokens and API keys it happened to
# hold. No tracked file has ever matched these patterns.
/data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.ab
